["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Notion’s Founder on the One Thing Your AI Is Missing vibe coding headless product\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-aiandi-notion创始人-ai能给你代码-但不该替你保管-理解/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9bccab920fb419de-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">33:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>Notion創始人：AI能給你代碼，但不該替你保管「理解」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Vibe coding讓人人都能做軟件，但Ivan Zhao認為真正耐久的不是UI和過程代碼，而是數據和上下文——誰掌握這個，誰才是AI時代的贏家。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Notion</span><span class=\"tag\">vibe coding</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Software factories and code reviews with Harjot Gill hill climbing software factory polyphasic sleep\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-pragmatic-创始人边开特斯拉fsd边指挥ai编码-月提交5000次/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1ee23f2f57f8e42d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Pragmatic Engineer</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>創始人邊開特斯拉FSD邊指揮AI編碼，月提交5000次</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">CodeRabbit創始人認為人工代碼評審已死，軟件工程的瓶頸從人才轉向token消耗，小團隊靠驅動AI代理也能做到Facebook級別的發布規模，但代價是鉅額算力和CPU賬單。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI編程</span><span class=\"tag\">軟件工廠</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Do Pigeons Navigate with Their Livers? A New Study Sparks Debate magnetoreception radical pair hypothesis cryptochrome macrophage superparamagnetism authorization vs appropriations\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-fromfirstprinc-鸽子用肝脏感知地球磁场-物理学家联手算出根本不可能/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dabc3192df79062a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">1:40:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From First Principles</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>鴿子用肝臟感知地球磁場？物理學家聯手算出根本不可能</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這篇登上Science封面的論文稱鴿子靠肝臟巨噬細胞在陰天導航，三位磁感應領域的元老級學者聯手計算後反駁：該機制在體溫下熱噪聲比磁場信號大30倍，物理上站不住腳。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">磁感應</span><span class=\"tag\">鴿子導航</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How To Build The Future: Eric Glyman, Co-CEO of Ramp Jevons paradox Coase&#x27;s theorem AI harness MCP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-ycsp-ramp-内部不招人一个季度-只为逼团队学会用-ai/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c6301d17041505af-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">54:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>Ramp 內部不招人一個季度，只為逼團隊學會用 AI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ramp 發現工程師用 AI 後生產力達到 100 倍，但銷售、設計跟不上就會拖垮組織，於是乾脆暫停整季招聘，強迫所有人把 AI 變成核心能力而非附加技能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業軟件</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Louise Michel, Anarchist Paris Commune Kanak\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-stuffmissed-审判席上她不求宽恕-只要求与同志们一起受罚/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">43:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>審判席上她不求寬恕，只要求與同志們一起受罰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法國政府以為流放和監禁能馴服她，結果路易絲·米歇爾在法庭上拒絕自辯，公開承認參與巴黎公社的一切行動並要求判處死刑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人物傳記</span><span class=\"tag\">法國歷史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Missing Layer for Personal AI | First Person Labs’ Ken Liu confidential inference zero data retention Second Local reflective productivity\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-a16z-ai给你建一个-第二人格-连创始人都看不到你的那份/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">33:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>AI給你建一個「第二人格」，連創始人都看不到你的那份</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">First Person Labs把數據和推理拆開：本地或機密計算裡跑模型，公司自己也證明不了能看到你的內容，信任靠硬件而不是承諾。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">個人AI</span><span class=\"tag\">機密計算</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How GTA VI Became the Most Expensive Video Game Ever Made performance capture microtransactions stranger encounters\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-oddlots-gta6烧掉十几亿美元-但制作人说这是个例-不是行业范本/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">50:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>GTA6燒掉十幾億美元，但製作人說這是個例，不是行業範本</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Rockstar靠GTA系列的確定性才敢把預算花到十幾億美元，而行業其他公司正因為銷量沒跟上預算增長而被迫削減開支，GTA6無法被複制。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">遊戲行業</span><span class=\"tag\">GTA6</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Vol.292｜施展×劉擎：從陰山互市到上海口岸，碰撞中的秩序生成 impersonal plus game\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-cn27f438-明朝打不过蒙古就开放互市-战争立刻消失了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7d46bbafb24c11f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"東\"><span class=\"dur\">35:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">東腔西調</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>明朝打不過蒙古就開放互市，戰爭立刻消失了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">嘉靖朝南倭北虜打得筋疲力盡，換了皇帝開放互市和海禁，戰爭就沒了——貿易不是零和博弈，規則常常是在衝突耗盡雙方之後、在交往界面上長出來的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">制度史</span><span class=\"tag\">上海</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Indigenous Entomology (BUGS &amp; TRADITIONAL ECOLOGICAL KNOWLEDGE) with Cheyenne Reuben-Thomas cultural fire Three Sisters traditional ecological knowledge (TEK)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-ologies-入侵物种也在-干自己的活-原住民生态知识不用好坏二分法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>入侵物種也在&quot;幹自己的活&quot;:原住民生態知識不用好壞二分法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">歐洲蜜蜂、亞洲瓢蟲這類常被叫作「入侵種」的生物，在原住民生態知識裡被看作在履行各自的生態職責，而不是非黑即白的敵人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">昆蟲學</span><span class=\"tag\">原住民知識</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"BI 250 Nima Dehghani: How Brains Compute computational closure functor divisive normalization winner-take-all wave walker / pilot wave\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-braininspired-ai-的-智能体-说法是误称-自主性要靠计算闭合-不是算力堆出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9d77f3058f9aa91-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">1:47:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Brain Inspired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>AI 的「智能體」說法是誤稱：自主性要靠計算閉合，不是算力堆出來的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">判斷一個系統有沒有自主性，不是看它能不能做圖靈完備的運算，而是看它的內部迴路能不能自己閉合——這正是現在所謂AI agent名不副實的地方。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神經科學</span><span class=\"tag\">計算理論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"157. 復盤Personal Agent集體誕生背後：和蔡偉聊AI產品史、需求真偽、入口與未來想像 harness MCP A2A\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-zhangxiaojun-个人助理的竞争短期看模型-中长期拼的是供给和安全信任/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7c56751483666a88-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:43:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>個人助理的競爭短期看模型，中長期拼的是供給和安全信任</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蔡偉判斷模型能力早晚會進入穩態、各家大差不差，屆時真正拉開差距的是誰手握更多線下供給、誰的安全合規做得足夠深。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Personal Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">AI產品策略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"對話 Google Cloud FDE 負責人王書元：FDE落到企業上，第一步是造“樣板間” FDE brain in a vat FDE BP nano banana self-distillation\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-guijilichang-别急着买工具-企业ai落地的第一步是造一个能跑通的样板间/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/38d8d27c2f34d3c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">硅基立場</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>別急著買工具，企業AI落地的第一步是造一個能跑通的樣板間</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">王書元說，AI不像數據庫這類舊技術升級——每個人對AI都有自己的理解，靠集思廣益很難推進，企業應該先在一個部門做出能閉環的樣板，再靠示範效應說服全公司跟進。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">FDE</span><span class=\"tag\">企業AI落地</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Are We Addicted to Control? with Dr Anna Lembke infinite flexibility mental map / mental model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-iq2-你的焦虑不是缺乏控制-而是控制过了头/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e254f7f220660b07-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">40:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Intelligence Squared</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>你的焦慮不是缺乏控制，而是控制過了頭</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Lembke 認為現代人的恐懼、孤獨和羞恥感根源於「無限可塑性」的幻覺——以為自己能掌控一切，結果一旦失控就只剩自責，而真正的解藥是向自己之外的更高力量交出意志。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心理健康</span><span class=\"tag\">自戀</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"414. Lawrence of Arabia: Palestine, Iraq, &amp; The Motorcycle Crash (Part 4)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-empirehist-劳伦斯空手赴巴黎和会-犹太代表团却带着水权地图谈妥一切/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">57:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>勞倫斯空手赴巴黎和會，猶太代表團卻帶著水權地圖談妥一切</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1919年巴黎和會上，阿拉伯代表團遲到、無文件、無策略，而猶太復國主義代表團已遊說六週並備好詳細的水權與移民方案，這場較量從一開始就不對等。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中東史</span><span class=\"tag\">巴以衝突</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Databricks CEO: AGI Is Already Here, Why Companies Are Behind, and the Superintelligence Debate ontology RSI (recursive self-improvement) paperclip maximizer\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-17-allin-他说agi去年就实现了-企业落后是因为连会都不敢录/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/74597b3fa701beb0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>他說AGI去年就實現了，企業落後是因為連會都不敢錄</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ali Ghodsi認為用他們當年AMP實驗室的定義，AGI去年就已達成，但企業卡在第一步——銀行CEO直接拒絕讓AI記錄會議，沒有上下文，再強的模型也幫不上忙。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業AI落地</span><span class=\"tag\">AI治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Water in the Mantle with Rita Parai mantle plume primordial isotope radiogenic isotope late veneer\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-17-geologybites-地幔柱的源头一开始是干的-水是后来被俯冲带进去的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9574accafd612c22-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">29:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Geology Bites</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>地幔柱的源頭一開始是乾的，水是後來被俯衝帶進去的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">惰性氣體同位素模型顯示，地幔柱源頭在地球吸積末期的水分比上地幔少4到250倍，但如今卻靠俯衝帶水反超上地幔達20倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地幔</span><span class=\"tag\">地幔柱</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Can AI Learn to Improve Itself? | Recursive Self-Improvement RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) perplexity chain of thought monitorability confessions research\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-17-a16z-ai研究员已经存在-但还没学会-品味/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">17:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>AI研究員已經存在，但還沒學會「品味」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI和Thinking Machines的兩位核心研究者認為，AI已能自主跑實驗、加速研究，但判斷哪個想法值得追的「品味」，仍然主要來自人類研究者的經驗而非模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">RSI</span><span class=\"tag\">AI對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How to compress text to 1 bit per character | Compression is Intelligence Part 3 arithmetic coding Hutter Prize cross-entropy asymmetric numeral system\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-17-karpathy-把文本压到每字符不到1比特-算术编码揭示压缩即预测/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/574b8c7bf81d687f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">37:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Andrej Karpathy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>把文本壓到每字符不到1比特：算術編碼揭示壓縮即預測</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">任何文本預測器都能通過算術編碼幾乎無損地變成壓縮器，反過來壓縮器也能還原出預測分布——壓縮率本質上取決於語言模型預測的好壞。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信息論</span><span class=\"tag\">語言模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"我給機械臂裝了個本地大模型：幾行代碼就能幹的活，為什麼要用AI？ NPU XDNA2 BFP16/BlockFP16 prefill/decode full fusion Quark\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-17-laoshi-给机械臂装大模型不为更快更准-是为听懂模糊指令/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/06b649dce3e37e38-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"老\"><span class=\"dur\">15:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">老石談芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>給機械臂裝大模型不為更快更準，是為聽懂模糊指令</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">傳統程序幾行代碼就能讓機械臂轉20度，但做不到理解「跟大家打個招呼」這種模糊意圖——這才是用AI的真正理由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">物理AI</span><span class=\"tag\">端側推理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Brad Gerstner &amp; Geoffrey Canada - Raising the Floor for Every American Child - [Invest Like the Best, EP.501] 530A account / Trump account cold start problem CalKids\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-17-ilt-美国已为7000万儿童自动开户-账户永久不可被国会撤销/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cb9087b8e12d941-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>美國已為7000萬兒童自動開戶，賬戶永久不可被國會撤銷</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">賬戶創建條款寫進法律永久生效，像社保一樣不會因換屆被廢除；真正每屆國會要重新撥款的只是出生時那1000美元的聯邦種子資金，到2029年前已有資金保障。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">財富分配</span><span class=\"tag\">慈善</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The secret to raising independent kids: Why connection matters more than you think with Dr. David Willis early relational health rupture and repair reflective functioning\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-17-secureattach-独立不是教出来的-是安全连接的副产品-搞反顺序孩子反而更不安/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>獨立不是教出來的，是安全連接的副產品，搞反順序孩子反而更不安</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">家長普遍相信先教獨立再談連接，但 Dr. Willis 認為自主、自信其實是強連接的副產品——過早逼孩子獨立，得到的是不安全感而不是獨立。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">依戀理論</span><span class=\"tag\">兒童發展</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Know the Score credit freeze hard inquiry FICO score\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-17-ninepi-信用分数本想消除偏见-却把历史不平等原样算进了分数里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e11e283634cdaaa8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"9\"><span class=\"dur\">37:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">99% Invisible</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>信用分數本想消除偏見，卻把歷史不平等原樣算進了分數里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">FICO算法確實讓貸款人不能再因為性別種族當面拒絕你，但它照單全收了幾百年種族歧視造成的財富差距，再把這個差距凍結成一個三位數。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信用評分</span><span class=\"tag\">金融史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Special Episode: Dr. Colin Elliott &amp; Pox Romana Pax Romana Antonine Plague orthopoxvirus\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-17-tpwky-罗马的强项反成瘟疫推手-道路-军队-贸易网全在帮倒忙/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">54:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>羅馬的強項反成瘟疫推手：道路、軍隊、貿易網全在幫倒忙</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">歷史學家Colin Elliott認為，這場瘟疫致死率可能只有1%-2%，但羅馬帝國本就結構脆弱，疫情只是加速了它本來就要發生的崩潰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">羅馬帝國</span><span class=\"tag\">瘟疫史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"298. Your Angry Son’s Outbursts: Set Limits Without Power Struggles | Dr. Tori Cordiano identified patient emotion regulation\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-17-asklisa-惩罚越升级-愤怒少年越自毁-他宁可失去一切也不服从/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/eed6f40091580f12-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">36:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>懲罰越升級，憤怒少年越自毀：他寧可失去一切也不服從</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">14歲男孩情緒失控時，沒收遊戲、加重懲罰只會觸發他為了拒絕被控制而自我毀滅一切；真正管用的是先守住安全和尊重兩條底線，再靠關係裡攢下的好感維繫約束力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青春期</span><span class=\"tag\">情緒調節</span>\n</div></div></a>"]